<title>USA: John Wiley &amp; Sons raises qtrly divs.</title>
<headline>John Wiley &amp; Sons raises qtrly divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Wiley &amp; Sons Inc said Thursday the quarterly dividend payable July 22 to shareholders of record July 8 will be $0.1125 per Class A share and $0.10 per Class B share.</p>
<p>The dividend increase will be about 13 percent per Class A share and 14 percent per Class B share, the company detailed.</p>
